  "version": 1,
  "$comment": "EXAMPLE CBOM — DOES NOT CONFORM to pkic.example.pqc-migration v0.1. Three distinct failures, each chosen to exercise machinery the baseline profile does not have. (1) svc-api-tls declares enablementMethod=software-update but no minimumProductVersion, so conditional rule M5 fires. (2) mgmt-ssh declares capabilityStatus=committed but no blockedBy, so conditional rule M11 fires. (3) ic-ipsec withholds implementationPurl, which the BASELINE permits but this profile does not, because the override on I9 removed withholdability. That third case is the interesting one: this document would conform to the baseline profile and fails only because the derived profile tightened an inherited rule.",
